{"server":"cn","storyId":"act35side_level_act35side_08_end","groupId":"act35side","stageId":"act35side_08","title":"黄沙尽头","storyCode":"AS-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"519b3ff36f13b281cef305d89eb6eb0c660513575cd7de243ef179aa7a4cb431","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_falls_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这又是什么地方啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瀑布？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"瀑布边，佩佩看见方才那个男孩正垂着头，清洗着什么。\n她快步上前，想要唤起男孩的注意，却发现他长高了些，脸庞已经褪去了孩童的稚嫩。\n现在的他，已经是个少年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，够了，不管你是谁！让我离开......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受伤了吗？你的脸上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，不用担心，这些血大多是敌人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战场上的情况比我想象中的要复杂，但他们都不是我的对手，我赢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜尔，在阿尔萨兰的雨林中，我为你在神庙中祈求了一副护身符。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我希望它能保护你不受伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怕，姐姐，那些伤痕都是我成长的证明。"},{"type":"narration","text":"低下头，佩佩看见半跪着的少年的膝旁，横放着一柄长剑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"几道鲜红的血液顺着剑身流入潭水中，将水面染成粉红一片。\n佩佩转头，看见背后的少女嘴角噙着温柔的笑意，但眼中却显露出担忧。\n她将头扭回，却发现四周再次变换了场景。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"narration","text":"雨林中，少年举起一把匕首，翻转着，打量个不停。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜你，从明天开始，就要统领父亲的卫戍部队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是你梦寐以求的职位，为什么你看着一点也不开心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道，与我付出的努力与艰辛相比，这把指挥官匕首实在是有些太轻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，姐姐？你不为我高兴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，祖拜尔，只有你开心，我才会高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些书卷，你已经在上面花费了无数个日夜。有找到什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜尔，萨尔贡的历史远比我们想象的更为悠久，但现存的抄本与记录都没有完整地将它们记述下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我打算编撰一部史籍，记录下那些被遗漏的前代事迹，最好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最好它能将萨尔贡的历史完整地记述。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"篇幅一定很长......你要写的人一定很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父亲认可了我的想法，他承诺会为我提供帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，我们都得到了自己想要的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"佩佩看到少年将匕首收回，对着姐姐露出笑容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外一个地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这又是什么时候......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你为何愁眉不展......祖拜尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位来自东方的库兰塔，他让父亲变得不一样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年，各个部族的叛乱与挑战都不能让父亲面容改色，一次又一次，他重整队伍，扬起旗帜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当父亲用长剑劈砍面前的敌人，那些自他们脖颈处溅射而出的血液，不能让他面具后的冰冷目光融化分毫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位梦魇......当父亲与他战斗的时候，兵器相接，所击出的火花点燃了父亲瞳孔中的火焰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从未见过他如此狂热地注视一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜尔，我能够察觉到......我们的父亲，他付诸国家的热情早已减退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我听到了一些令人忐忑的消息，父亲他打算邀请哈兰杜汗一同挥师南下，去挑战那里的无形之敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也要去，对吗，祖拜尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些怪诞的敌人已经在步步侵蚀我们的土地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙阿......你们都是沙阿的孩子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"跟着青年的视线向远处眺望，忽然间，千里之外的土地被一股引力拉至眼前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert03_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"佩佩看到了一片寸草不生的荒漠，风中夹着沙粒，打在她的眼皮上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......焚风热土......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜尔，你感觉怎么样了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好，姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我现在为你换药，需要揭开你身上的绷带，忍耐下，很快就结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不痛，没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会不痛呢，你被抬回来的时候，浑身焦黑，没有一块皮肤是完好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我该怎么办，祖拜尔......父亲不知所踪，你是我最后的亲人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王兄已经即位，我们与他并非一母同出，你在军中立下的功绩已经让他有所忌惮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位史官先生......他对你好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......有他帮忙，那本史籍的编撰已近一半，或许在我有生之年，能有机会见到它的完本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该太过操劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是我对父亲的承诺......就算我完不成，我腹中的孩子也会继续......终有一日，它会告诉后来人，此时此刻所发生的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它会隔着遥远的时光，架起一座桥梁，让读者与所记录的人物在漫漫历史长河中彼此相认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说，他们要为父亲修建一座衣冠冢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲在离开前，将那座藏满世间珍奇的宝库地址告诉了我，他让我等待梦魇的后裔，将其中的一切尽数给予他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王兄知道了不会高兴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你选择了用笔记下父亲的一言一行来缅怀他的离去，而我选择守护他留下的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲才刚刚离开，西南各个部族便又升起烽烟......总要有人去平定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你这样......你这样要怎么去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位来自阿尔萨兰的宝石匠人告诉我，他可以通过篆刻特殊回路的宝石保留我的意识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而制作长生军的工匠们也愿意为我打造另一副躯壳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是打定主意才告诉我的吗，祖拜尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我不想永远躺在床铺上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜尔，我只想你能快乐，除此外，别无所求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"答应我你会永远记得这句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我答应你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（我......我在哪里？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（好黑......有人吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（为、为什么说不出话？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（可恶，根本没法动弹，有人捆住了我的手脚。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"准备好了吗？我要将他的大脑取出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（脑子？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再来点麻醉药剂，我监测到他的脉搏还是跳得很快，我需要让他平静下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（你们要取谁的脑子！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"面前的遮挡物被拿开，光线从外界进入，佩佩发现自己此刻正躺在一座石台中央。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"周围的人来来往往，不断往她的身体上涂抹刺鼻的黏稠药物，还用浸湿的麻布条将她裹紧，这便是她一直无法活动的原因。\n还来不及继续观察，佩佩便看到一位老者手持细长的小刀向自己走来，本应陷入慌张的她却因为药物的作用而逐渐安定。\n她感觉到头颅被人按住，刀刃缓缓抵向额心......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（这是祖拜尔的经历吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（原来被提取意识的时候......他还活着。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结束了吗？这些就是你想为我展示的吗，祖拜尔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，后来你又经历了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这样等候了近千年的时光吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜尔，告诉我，在你漫长的一生中，尽管痛苦难忍，但你是否有过那么一刻，想要忘记自己的姐姐、自己的父亲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是我的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不该遗忘，那就记住，即便会带来痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......回来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有巨大的凶兽，没有潮湿的雨林，没有灼热的风沙。\n街道正中，只有一只小动物蹲在那里，轻轻舔舐自己的皮毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要将我带入祖拜尔的记忆之中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是祖拜尔为你设下的考验，只有通过，你才能见到他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才，在幻境之中，与我对答的人是他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那其实是我，但问题确实是他为你预设下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我通过了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你失败了，从哪里来的就滚回哪里去吧，小丫头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他在幻境里不还对我的回答挺满意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，都是你的错觉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须见到他，城市中的骚乱因他而起，只有他才能停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况......要进入黄金之城，只有他能帮我达成，我不想放弃这最后的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢丫头，你以为去黄金之城做史官是什么好差事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为要随侍在王者身侧，为了确保秘密不被泄露，他们都会被割去舌头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所记述的，不过是万王之王希望你记述的，从此你不再是自己，不过是王者的喉舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的愿意吗，蠢丫头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些你又是从哪里知道的？黄金之城可不是随便一只动物就能去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢丫头，我饲养的第一只小人类可是路加萨尔古斯的小女儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我亲眼目睹那个可怜的女孩被自己的哥哥割掉了舌头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"够了，米奥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她已经通过了祖拜尔的考验，放她过去，不要多言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在第三条小巷往里走倒数第二间民居中等你，记住，进去后先敲三下左边的门，然后直接推开右边的门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就会见到他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这混蛋，她没有通过考验，你凭什么要说出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已经通过考验了，米奥，不要再胡搅蛮缠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没过！我说没过就没过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢货，你难道要看这丫头变成......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放开我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的任务已经完成了！快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"衔住米奥的后脖颈，沃奥将它拖进巷口，留给佩佩的只有一道尘土中的拖痕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......第三条小巷里倒数第二间民居......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先敲三下左边的门......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后直接推开右边的门......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又见面了，佩佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有个问题，如果我不按那只动物说的，先敲门再推门，我还能见到你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实随便你推开哪扇门都能够见到我，重点是你到底想不想见我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜尔，我是带着锤子来找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算使用武力胁迫我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不保证不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间不多了，我问你答，不要欺骗我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你问吧，佩佩，我会坦诚以待。但我并非因为你的恐吓而屈服，我回答只是因为我愿意回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经找到第四颗宝石了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，有人一直为我保管着这颗宝石，其家族代代相传，就是为了等待某天我苏醒，将其奉还。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一拿到它就决定毁掉整座城市吗？外面已经因为宝石构装体乱做一团了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩佩，城市中发生的事情我很抱歉，但我必须那么做，这是我的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“第四颗代表肝脏，我们清醒着进入夜晚，为了职责与义务。”有关你职责的记忆终于完整了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙阿的宝库到底在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在我们脚下，就在米纳特哈玛仪这座城市的下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以说，这座城市的建立、富饶与兴盛都要仰仗父亲所留下的无尽宝藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲离去后，我将他的衣冠冢修建在他的宝库最深处，这间宝库亦是他的陵寝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数百年的时间里，他们不停向地底发掘，在陵寝中获得的每一件文物与珍宝都化作了供养这座城市的养分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的失职，但现在还不晚，尚有挽救的机会，他们还没有挖掘到最深处的......那些绝不容他人染指的珍宝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那到底是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急，佩佩，这正是我想要展示给你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一束阳光从窗外射入，打在祖拜尔的脚边。\n祖拜尔高高举起手杖，上端的叉铃被不知从何而起的狂风卷动，发出清脆悠扬的铃声。\n伴着铃响，佩佩听见祖拜尔哼起一首旋律莫名熟悉的歌谣，但歌词却晦涩难懂。\n随即，女孩感觉到自己脚下坚实的土地变得柔软，仿若流动的沙地，她的脚踝早已深陷其中。\n当祖拜尔的歌声行至结尾，他便将手杖重重扎进地面。\n不过瞬间，沙尘四散扬起，没去了二人的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g5_museum"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水！拿水来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点！你们的阿娜特馆长逞强说了太多话，现在中暑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坏消息——博物馆停水很久了，梅捷缇克缇女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准确来说，所有的水龙头现在都在往外流沙子，关都关不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是博物馆的员工吗？我看你有点陌生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，等等，所有的水龙头......只有沙子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。顺带一提，这是我们抵达的时候，你们的员工让我转交的一张请假条，还有一堆书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道他想去哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"河水现在十分浑浊，无法取用，附近的净水渠也被黄沙填满了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切都是刚刚我们赶过来的路上发生的事，快得就像洪水涨起来漫过堤岸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，漫灌节，只不过漫出来的是沙子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘿，女士？你怎么不说话？有这么不好笑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿娜特，阿娜特，快醒醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我们......我们要死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天发生了这么多事情，你到现在才反应过来要死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齐娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅捷缇克缇女士，能请你具体说一下情况吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"简单来说，如果全城所有的宝石都可能被拆除，那么河道中用于净水的宝石也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大量宝石被拆掉了，就会导致净水系统停转，压力变化，黄沙倒灌......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这样一来，宝石构装体就有源源不断的材料，能垒起石柱与高墙，破坏城市现在的样貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，缇缇，我担心还有更糟糕的情况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么突然的压力变化，会导致古代的地下河道工程受损。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我本来不想说出来的，阿娜特，我怕说出来就变成真的！我现在真的害怕这座城市了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，地下河道受损，然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大量的水分渗透会使这一带的砂土变得松软，形成流沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整座城市会沉降，构装体所不能消化的现代材料将埋入黄沙深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上我的一点推测......构装体并非平白无故在街道上建起立柱与高墙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们在复原自己记忆中这里的景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们所有人，连带数百年城市文明的痕迹，都会被埋回黄沙之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......需要我解释得更清楚一点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我完全懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城市如果被沙子淹没，我们都会死，你们会死，我的手下也会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，为了保护我的手下，我是不是只有一条路可以走了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
